# Accepted findings for this example image.
#
# TEE-Crafter's vulnerability gate blocks on findings that have an upstream fix
# (see apps/cli/src/tee_crafter/core/security/vuln_scan.py).  The two below are
# reported as fixable but cannot be fixed in this image, for reasons that are
# structural rather than a matter of bumping a version.  Each was traced to
# ground before being listed here; do not add entries without doing the same.
#
# Both come from `site-packages/pip/_vendor/vendor.txt`, the pinned manifest of
# pip's *own* vendored tree — not from this app's dependency set:
#
#   $ docker run --rm <image> grep -iE 'msgpack|setuptools' \
#       /usr/local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pip/_vendor/vendor.txt
#   msgpack==1.1.2
#   setuptools==70.3.0
#
# Neither is an installed package.  `pip list` in the built image reports
# setuptools 84.0.0 and no msgpack at all, and the only other place the string
# `70.3.0` appears is pip's own `_vendor/bom.cdx.json`.  So the `--upgrade
# setuptools` in the Dockerfile does run, and cannot clear either finding.
#
# There is no upstream fix to wait for: pip 26.2.1 — the current release as of
# 2026-08-22 — still pins exactly these two versions.
#
# Deleting pip from the image *does* clear both, and it was tried here on
# 2026-08-22.  It is wrong: TEE-Crafter's Nitro overlay
# (templates/common/Dockerfile.container.template) does `FROM __USER_IMAGE__`
# followed by `RUN python -m pip install ...` to layer the TEE runtime on top of
# the user image, so an image with no pip cannot be deployed to `nitro-aws` at
# all.  Removing pip trades a suppressed finding for a broken platform.  The
# same conclusion is recorded in examples/docker_flask_api/.trivyignore, which
# reached it first.
#
# Re-check on a pip release that refreshes its vendored msgpack/setuptools, and
# delete the corresponding line when it does.

# setuptools: path traversal in PackageIndex. pip-vendored manifest entry only.
CVE-2025-47273

# msgpack: OOB read on Unpacker reuse. pip-vendored manifest entry only.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
